     1,
     "<div>Hi - I&#39;m trying to calculate measurement error via the RRPP package function measurement.error( )</div><div><br></div><div>The help file <a href=\"https://geomorphr.r-universe.dev/geomorph/doc/manual.html#gm.measurement.error\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://geomorphr.r-universe.dev/geomorph/doc/manual.html%23gm.measurement.error&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792483220446000&amp;usg=AOvVaw04TuMNlP0vYDTyHqVvwquA\">references a dataset called &quot;fishy,&quot; </a>but I cannot find this dataset.  Here is some of the code for this section:<br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>data(&quot;fishy&quot;)</div><div><br></div><div>measurement.error(<br>  Y = &quot;coords&quot;,<br>  subjects = &quot;subj&quot;,<br>  replicates = &quot;reps&quot;,<br>  groups = &quot;groups&quot;,<br>  data = fishy)</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>How can I access the &quot;fishy&quot; dataset?</div><div><br>Thank you so much!</div><div><br></div><div>\r\n<div><span>Claudia M. Astorino </span></div><div><div>Ph.D. Candidate<br></div><div>Biological Anthropology</div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><a title=\"NYCEP\" href=\"https://nycep.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://nycep.org/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792483220446000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3WmnqR8CgTkZNC87lAwsWg\">NYCEP</a><br></div><div><a title=\"CUNY Graduate Center\" href=\"https://www.gc.cuny.edu/anthropology\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.gc.cuny.edu/anthropology&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792483220446000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0LbNeJBQy3HsK9QG2D8Pf4\">CUNY Graduate Center</a></div><div>365 Fifth Avenue<br>New York, NY 10016</div><div><a href=\"http://cmastorino.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.c