     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>\r\n<div>Hi - I&#39;m trying to calculate measurement error via the RRPP package function measurement.error( )</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>The help file <a href=\"https://geomorphr.r-universe.dev/geomorph/doc/manual.html#gm.measurement.error\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://geomorphr.r-universe.dev/geomorph/doc/manual.html%23gm.measurement.error&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792483220448000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1VcUz_NCztqDoOdrS0eGj5\">\r\nreferences a dataset called &quot;fishy,&quot; </a>but I cannot find this dataset.  Here is some of the code for this section:<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>data(&quot;fishy&quot;)</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>measurement.error(<br>\r\n  Y = &quot;coords&quot;,<br>\r\n  subjects = &quot;subj&quot;,<br>\r\n  replicates = &quot;reps&quot;,<br>\r\n  groups = &quot;groups&quot;,<br>\r\n  data = fishy)</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>How can I access the &quot;fishy&quot; dataset?</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\nThank you so much!</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div><span>Claudia M. Astorino </span></div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>Ph.D. Candidate<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>Biological Anthropology</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><a title=\"NYCEP\" href=\"https://nycep.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://nycep.org/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792483220448000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1wK9nIZPCA3LJx0rFlIhPt\">NYCEP</a><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><a title=\"CUNY Graduate Center\" href=\"https://www.gc.cuny.edu/anthropology\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.gc.cuny.edu/anthropology&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792483220448000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1NXRBOVULtE_YqzO0MaJvg\">CUNY Graduate Center</a></div>